[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OVERLORD]
Overlord

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OVERLORD_desc]
Duchess Trixie Lulamoon told stories of the day the twins first came to her. They came with promises and visions, one we would stand beside them. And if only looked to them, they would unite us with the WETM.\nBut their vision did not inspire us for long. They will soon know that loyalty in Equestria is fleeting.\nThere are, others, who see our value. Let the internal combustion engine and the electric generator throw themselves into competition for the market.\nWe have survived this long not by strength, but by seizing opportunity when it so eagerly presents itself.

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OVERLORD_BONUS]
The Free Equestria’s Sharing

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OVERLORD]
四海皆臣

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OVERLORD_desc]
特丽克西公爵讲述她与两兄弟合作第一天的故事。他带着承诺和愿景来到此处，我们会站在他身边，只要我们仰望他们，他们就会将我们与遥远的西小马国贸易市场连接。\n但他们的愿景并没有长期激励我们。他们很快就会明白，在小马利亚，忠诚是转瞬即逝的。\n还有其他国家看到了我们的价值。让内燃机和发电机互相竞争抢夺市场吧。\n我们能存活于世靠的不是力量，而是能在机会出现时抓住它。

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OVERLORD_BONUS]
自由小马利亚的分享

